<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2 OP- ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">2 Opita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwopo Mbaa OPITA</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Opita</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 P</para>
  <para style="mt">Kwupu Ungwopo Mbaa OPITA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu Ungwopo ungwu Opita kwɔlɛ a ka laa Wambwalu umba kwonze. A ka ngwu te kaa lo to ewa mbala ɛduma iyi wazɔ ɛzu iyangba mbala ira iyi i wɔ mbaa ɛzu ɛnyi tayi. Epu iyi ira iyi i wɔ mbaa ɛzu iyi ira ɛlɛ te gba akwu tee lo ra la iyitu iyi Ukpo mbala iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gbagiri. Iyitu ɛlɛ i ngyi mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o ma Ɔzhizɔsi mu eyi mbo akwɛyi o pwa ɛzu iyi bɔkɔ a zɔ. Iyi i shi u ka kwupu kwɔlɛ ubu ugyi gba akwu isomo iyi enzu mbɔlɛ tee Okrasi a ŋa gbama fo. Azɔ tee Ukpo &lt;&lt;a gyite onzu uwunawuna le kpɛdɔma mo, a gyite uwewe le kwu ira wu ɔsu.&gt;&gt; Ɛlɛ gba i shi enzu o ma kyamate tee Okrasi a gbama ɛfya mo le.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyama Mbala Luzɛ Undu Umbwalu (1.3-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Wazɔ Ɛzu Iyangba (2.1-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Igbama Iyi Okrasi Imbwambwa (3.1-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Imi Ɔsamɔ Opita, mi kwu umɛgba mbala uzilɔ uwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Kwupu kwɔlɛ mi ka mi ka yi lunyi umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi yi ikwu idu lu fulo iyeshi kyamate iyanzu kwuwongu ototo uwu Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Kuwongwu bɔkɔ lu yitu iyi Ukpo mbala Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi }Okrasi awu, Ukpo le shi yi esheshi mbala idigbomo duduu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyama Mbala Iŋama Iyi Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Ukpo e shi nzu iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ ki gyi kaa la ki wo iyi bɔkɔ i she wu. Ɛlɛ i womo tayi kwuwongu bɔkɔ ki yitu wu, uwu bɔkɔ a ya nzu ma kaa la ki kyo mu inzumbɛku mbala egbo iyeshi wu. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Kwuwongwu apula ɛlɛ, e shi nzu apula iyɛku iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ e siso e shi mɛzhi te ee wo nzu, kaa li wa nzu ma mu apula iyira iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, akwɛyi luu yi ari kyamate iyi Ukpo tayi.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ la lu kpapyi mu ikwu idu lu fulo yi la lu kyo luzɛ undesheshi, luzɛ undesheshi la lu kyo iyitu; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />mu iyitu la lu kyo iyɛyi ma, mu iyɛyi ma la lu kyo idu iyimo; mu idu iyimo la lu kyo iyi iyi Ukpo; <note caller="+" style="f" /> <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />mu iyi iyi Ukpo la lu kyo igyi esu iyi imɛnɛ; mu igyi esu iyi imɛnɛ la lu kyo idɛnyi ireyi. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Moo gba ɛlɛ te i yi mu ikyomo ma yi, iyitu yi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi ikɔma akwɛyi ii wa la apula iyeshi kwudu. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ishi gba onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi ɛlɛ mo a ma ɛbɛ marimari mo ba e yi mate upeyi tayi, ba a kalakwuleyi te Ɔzhizɔsi a gba la ingbomo wu iyekyi a kpa wu-o. <verse eid="2PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ɛmɛnɛ mi, la lu gyakpɔ mu ɛlɛ iwomo kaa li zɔ tee Ukpo gba a ŋa yi le. Gba lu wo ɛlɛ, lu kpa mɛzhi gbee mo, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />akwɛyi Ukpo aa na yi marimari mbaa bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Ɔkwu nzu e rɛsu wu iyɔkpɔɔ awu.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Lunyi lu yitu iyi apula ɛlɛ-ɛ ba lu rima agiri mu ɛzɔ iyi ongbulolo iyi bɔkɔ o zɔ yi awu, tetete Imi mi koko mi lolo yi. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Mi mate i fate la mi koko la mi lolo yi ta bɔkɔ mi degbo la reyi bɛnɛ le kaa la lu kalakwuleyi mo, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />moo Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a zɔ mi gedegede te mi nda la ikpomo fo. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, mi yi mu ibɔkpɔ te la mi zɔ yi ɛlɛ, ka la gba mi kpomo la lu koko la lu lolo yi lɛɛbi.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enzu Umba Bɔkɔ O Ma inzumbɛku Iyi Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Iso iyi bɔkɔ ki so yi te Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Ɔkwu nzu aa gbama la ekpasu wu awu akwu kwoso mo, kinzu ba ki ma inzumbɛku wu meyi nzu. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ukpo Ada e shi wu umwɔ mbala inzumbɛku awu, kinzu ki yi mɔmɔ, opwu uwɔkwuu u wɔ mbaa Ukpo u ka le u zɔ tee,&lt;&lt;Ele akwu Umɛ mi, uwu mi pwu idɛnyi wu; Imi mi mwɔnyɛ wu gyɔɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Kinzu umba bɔkɔ ki yi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi ki pwa opwu ɔlɛ mafyi nzu, uwu bɔkɔ u wɔ mu lɔwa lɔkɛrikɛri ndɔndu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e siso.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Kekelele gba ki yitu tee iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu o so awu akwu kego ŋa le, lunyi ba la lu ngbɛ alu ɔnyɛnyɛ mu iso ɛlɛ nzhii ba igbama iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Igbama wu i nya la ɛbɛ kyamate utu uwu eyifumo tayi akwɛyi e yi mate kwulovyo ungwu eyi i lama tayi. Kwuye kwɔngu, ɔyi wu u zɔ yi ɛbɛ mu egbo yi kaa li zɔ yi Ukpo marimari. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Iyi bɔkɔ i ka le gba i yi tee, la lu lolo te, onzu uwunawuna e do te a lu iso iyi Ukpo mu ubwu wu byi mo. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Moo iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu o ka, ii ngyi mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ onzu a gyi byi mo, akwu enzu umba bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e shi mbo ekpasu le gba o ka iso iyi bɔkɔ i ngyi mbaa Ukpo le.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Wa Zɔ Ɛzu Iyi Angba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Mekyi anukenzu umba angba o kyo o yi meka iyi enzu umba Ukpo, kyamate bɔkɔ wa zɔ kiya umba angba o ŋɔɔ yi meka yi tayi. Ɛzu iyi angba ɛlɛ i ngbɛ enzu umba bɔkɔ o nyama la yi ɛdɔma. Enzu mbɔlɛ lala ɔ zɔ te o yitu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ a wamba ma mu rinye awu mo. Iwomo mbo ɛlɛ, ii shi Ukpo a ngbɛ mba ɛdɔma efyefya. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Enzu wa mbwalu gyɔɔ ɔ vɔngɔ ari iyira mba ɛlɛ akwɛyi ii shi enzu o siso iyira iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu ongbulolo ɔlɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Wa zɔ ɛzu iyi angba mbɔlɛ akwu enzu umba ekweyi, oo kyoro yi mo mu esepo ibama iyi bɔkɔ umba o ka mu afyi mba kaka kaa lo fya eduwo munyi yi. Ukpo a ka mu egbo wu mekyeki te e lo mbo inyashi, uwu a ŋe wo yi tayi mega.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Lunyi lu yitu te, mekyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo o fo ɛrama wu ma awu, Ukpo a zeyi e lo mbo tayi mo, a ta mba mu kwumbɛ ungwu ipu mbaa bɔkɔ ee fu enzu umbira lɛɛbi. Ukpo ee shi mbo mu kwumbɛ ungwu ipu tayi nzhii ba ɔnuwu bɔkɔ e be fu mbo ombu. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Lunyi lu yitu tee, mekyi enzu o lomo la iso iyi Ukpo mo, Ukpo ba a zeyi e lo mbo mu iyira iyi bɔkɔ umba o yi mu iwomo tayi mo, kwuwo kwɔlɛ e shi embyi o ri mbo mo. Onowa u tanu uwu iso iyi ototo mbala enzu umbafo werewo ba Ukpo a sa mba ma. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Ukpo a ngbɛ enzu umba ese iyi Ɔsɔdɔmu mbala Ogomora ɛdɔma akwɛyi e shi ɔyi u pwu ese ɛnyi ma nzhii ba akwu kwulɔ. E wo ɛlɛ te kaa la zɔ enzu te, ɛlɛ gba ii du enzu umba bɔkɔ o lo wu mo mo le. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Ukpo a sa Ɔlɔtu onzu ototo ma, kwuwongu ubwu wu e tutumo gyɔɔ kwuwongu ira iyi enzu umba Ɔsɔdɔmu kwuwongu o lomo la iso iyi Ukpo mo. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Onzu ele e yi mbala enzu umbira mbɔlɛ, kwɔfyi kwɔfyi a ma apula iyira iyi bɔkɔ umba o wo, a pwa iso iyira iyi bɔkɔ umba o so, akwɛyi ɛlɛ kpɛkpɛyi i tutu wu egbo mo gyɔɔ kwuwongu akwu onzu ototo. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Ukpo e yi ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ a sa enzu umba bɔkɔ o wiyi wu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ipwama i du mbo, akwɛyi enzu umbira ba e yi mbo kwuwo akwɛyi e lo mbo inyashi nzhii ba ɔnuwu ombu izɔma. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo apula iyira iyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu mba i gyi te li wo akwɛyi i ngbɛ ɛnwu mba ɛdɔma, akwɛyi o towo ɛrama wu imbwaluma awu, Ukpo e lo mbo inyashi i ka le.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Wa zɔ ɛzu iyi angba mbɔlɛ o wiyi iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ umba o ka mu egbo mbo te oo wo mo ba o to ɛmba o fulo kadu, alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo ba o ga mba ari ikpama mo. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo umba bɔkɔ o ka wa zɔ ɛzu iyi angba ekpasu ma lala, oo kpa wa zɔ ɛzu iyi angba mbɔlɛ ari mu idu iyi Ɔkwu mo. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Enzu mbɔlɛ ba o so iso iyira iyi Ukpo mu iso iyi bɔkɔ o zɔngɔma yi ma mo. O yi mate izɔfyi umba o byi egbo mo tayi, umba o mbwalu iyi bɔkɔ egbo mbo i so mbo byi, o mba mba te kaa lo yi mbo kaa lo ngbɛ ma bi. Enzu mbɔlɛ Ukpo a ngbɛ mba ɛdɔma mate bɔkɔ enzu ɔ ngbɛ izɔfyi tayi.<verse eid="2PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Kwuwongwu bɔkɔ o lo enzu inyashi awu, Ukpo e lo mbo inyashi iyɛku tete. Wa zɔ ɛzu iyi angba mbɔlɛ ba o ma te a kwamba ɔnyɛ te kaa lo ri lo wo gyɔɔ mu ɔnɔnda gedegede. Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o yi mu kiya irimo mbala yi, ii shi mbo ɔnyɛ te kaa lo wo ɛlɛ. Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, iwomo mbo ɛlɛ i ngbɛ ɛnyi yi ɛdɔma akwɛyi i ka yi la lovya mbala eseye. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Kwuye ungwunanguna egbo mbo i yi mbaa eko kaa lo nɔ mbala mba; umba o nyama te lo lafya la ira iwomo gbee mo; umba oo kpa ida la enzu umba bɔkɔ o kɔma mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma mo kaa lo kpa mɛzhi mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma. Enzu mbɔlɛ akwu enzu umba ekweyi gyɔɔ; Ukpo a ta mba kenzu-o! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Enzu mbɔlɛ o lafya la ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo akwɛyi o le mu apula iyira iwomo kyamate Obalamu umɛ uwu Ɔbɛyɔ e wo tayi. Obalamu ele a gyi eduwo gyɔɔ akwɛyi e wo iyinayina e kaa la fya yi byi. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Akwɛyi o kpa wu ɛyi kwuwongu ira iyi bɔkɔ e yi mu iwomo awu, ɔzɛki uwu bɔkɔ e siso kego mo awu, e siso mate onzu tayi akwɛyi a nyi anukenzu Obalamu ira iwomo kwuye kwɔngu.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Wa zɔ ɛzu iyi angba mbɔlɛ o yi kya mate anga iyi ɛwuru tayi mu embyi, o yi kyamate kubwu ungwu kwu kpo embyi mo tayi, o gba o yi kyamate amu iyi bɔkɔ kwokpo kwu pya yi ma tayi. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kizɛ ingyi ipwu kpakiri gba Ukpo e shembo le. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Moo iyi bɔkɔ o zɔ enzu i yi kyamate iso iyeshi tayi, munɛ ba akwu iso iyi umbwa, o za la enzu te lo wo apula iyi lovya iyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu mba i gyi iwomo, iso mbo ɛnyi akwu kyamate kwuda la enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwira ɔsu iyepo. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Oo za la enzu te, lu kwu enye fo, munɛ ba umba akwu enye umba apula iyira iwomo. Moo onzu akwu unye uwu kiya ingyinangyina ingyi ki to wu egbo mo ndii. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Akwiyi gba enzu mbɔlɛ o lafya la apula iyira iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ iyi i tutu enzu mo, akwɛyi o na Ɔkwu mbala usama nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, akwɛyi kekelele o gba la apula iyira ɛnyi iwomo nzhii ba iyira ɛnyi i to mbo egbo mo ndii, iyimo iyi enzu mbɔlɛ mu imbwama yi, i ka ira la iyekyi ma. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />I bi shoshi i ka le gba enzu mbɔlɛ lo yitu iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu ototo mekyi mo, bɔkɔ o yitu wu dɛ akwɛyi o lafya la ɛrama iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ o zɔ mba imbwaluma. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Aba ɛlɛ i zɛ kya mu reshi mbo te,&lt;&lt;Izu a gba la iko wu ilɛma,&gt;&gt; mbala, &lt;&lt;Orisu uwu bɔkɔ o wo wu mo, a gba a ke fye mu ɔtɔtɔ kpɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Iso Ishi mɛzhi Iyi Igbama Iyi Ɔkwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Ɛmɛza mi, kwupwu kwɔlɛ akwu ungwopo ungwu mi ka mi ka yi le. Mu epu epepo iyi mi ka mi ka yi awu, mi lolo yi iyi apula ɛnyi kaa li mbwa yi ma kaa la lu byi egbo ɔnyɛnyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Mi gyi te la lu lolo iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu umba Ɔkɛrikɛri o so mekyi mbala ɛzɔ iyi Ɔkwu nzu usama iyi bɔkɔ wa zɛ ilɔ o zɔ yi awu.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Iyi kwonze, akwu mega kaa la lu yitu te, mu afyi iyi mbwambwa enzu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o wo kiya ingyi idu mbo bi gyi, o nyɔ oo wo yi ɛnɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />O yo yi kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Mate e so e shi mɛzhi te uwu a gbama lo, e bo-o? Ngbaa ta bɔkɔ umba asɔkwu nzu o kpomo le, iyinayina te gba i yi le ngba mu iyemo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />O ka la kwuleyi ungwu iyayigbɛ te, oshi u yi ngbaa mekyi. Ukpo a ta ɔkpa akwɛyi ɛzhi i wɔ mu embyi akwɛyi e shi ɛzhi i wɔ mekeka iyi embyi. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Akwu mu ilomo iyi embyi mbɔlɛ tete gba Ukpo akwu kwudu ungwekyi ma le. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Mu ɔkpa uwu Ukpo ele tete gba oshi mbala ɛzhi iyi kekelele o shiyebyi la ɔnuwu ombu, kaa lo pwu yi mo mɔyi mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi Ukpo mo le. <verse eid="2PE 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ɛmɛza umba idu mi, lunyi la lu kalakwuleyi ungwu iso ɛlɛ mo: Midu iyi Ukpo, kwɔfyi kwukpɛnyi kwu yi kyamate lɔri odubu tayi, lɔri odubu ba lu yi kyamate kwɔfyi kwunyi tayi. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Akwu te Ukpo e kiri ɛnwu iyi kaa le wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi kyamate bɔkɔ enzu umbafo o ka mu egbo mbo mo awu mo. E yi mu idu iyimo mbala yi, kwuwongu a gyi te onzu ukpukpɛnyi te le kpo ɛdɔma mo. A gyi te onzonzu le kwira wu ɔsu.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Kwɔfyi ungwu Ɔkwu ba kwu nyɔ kyamate i nyɔma iyi uwɛlɔ tayi. Kwuye kwɔngu anu iyɛkuu ii wɔ, akwɛyi oshi u tomo, apula iyi bɔkɔ i yi moshi lɛɛbi i pwumo akwɛyi i kpo ɛdɔ ma, akwɛyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mbala apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ i yi ma ngu i tomo ndii.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Tabɔkɔ apula lɛɛbi i kpo ɛdɔma mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔlɛ te le, i fa te la lu ngbɛndu mu luzɛ yi, lunyi la lu yi egbo iyesheshi kaa la lu zɛ luzɛ undu lu she la Ukpo. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Tabɔkɔ lu rigbo la kwɔfyi ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a ka te a gbama, la lu gyakpɔɔ kaa la lu shi ngwu la kwu bo efyefya. Mu kwɔfyi kwɔngu Ukpo e pwu oshi ma akwɛyi apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ i yi moshi awu i wolomo minaa. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Kinzu ba ki rigbo i yi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi te ee shi nzu oshi uwepo mbala ɛzhi iyepo iyi bɔkɔ akwu kwogba ungwu ototo.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ɛmɛza umba idu mi, mate bɔkɔ lu rigbo kwɔfyi kwɔngu awu, la lu gyakpɔɔ kaa la lu yi sɛsɛsɛ mbaa Ukpo kaa la lu yi kwuto mo ba lo la yi kenzu mɛnwu mo, lunyi ba la lu yi iŋɔma iyi oloto mbala Ukpo. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />La lu yitu te idu iyimo iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi akwu kwuwongu bɔkɔ a gyi te la sa enzu ma le, kyamate bɔkɔ umanyi nzu Ɔpɔlu Ukpo e shi wu ilukwu akwɛyi a kakwupu a ka yi awu. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Ɛlɛ gba akwiyi bɔkɔ e so le mu epu wu lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ a ka. Iso iyifo iyi bɔkɔ a ka, i kɔma mu izɔngɔma. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi kiya mo mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o ki alɛ ma mɛzhi mo, o luyima mu ɔgwuzɛ owa, kyamate bɔkɔ o wo mbala ekpo iyi iso iyi Ukpo iyifo tayi awu. Ɛlɛ gba ba i shi Ukpo a ngbɛ mba ɛdɔma le. <verse eid="2PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ɛmɛza umba idu mi, mate bɔkɔ lu yitu iyi ɛlɛ-ɛ awu, la lu rima ngiri kaa enzu mbɔlɛ umba bɔkɔ o lomo la iso iyi Ukpo mo awu, lo shi yi kaa la lu lafya la ɔgwuzɛ uwu isama ɔlɛ mo. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Lunyi ba la lu kwo bulɔma mu esheshi mbala ilukwu iyi Ɔkwu nzu mbala u sa ma nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ e yi inzumbɛku iyɔkpɔɔ awu! Li yi tayi.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>